# NEXUS Data Cleanroom 1.0

AI-powered data cleaning and event log generation system for ERP data.

## 🎯 Features

- ✅ Multi-ERP support (SAP, Logo, Mikro, Canias)
- ✅ AI-assisted column mapping (Heuristic + Embedding + LLM)
- ✅ Data quality validation and anomaly detection
- ✅ Event log generation for process mining
- ✅ Human-in-the-loop review console
- ✅ Local LLM support (Ollama + Qwen2.5)

## 🏗️ Architecture

ERP Systems → M2 (Connectors) → M3 (AI Mapping) → M4 (Quality Check)
→ M5 (Event Builder) → M6 (Review Console) → M7 (Event Log Storage)

## 🚀 Quick Start

### Prerequisites
- Python 3.10+
- PostgreSQL 15+
- Ollama (optional)
- Node.js 18+ (for frontend)

### Installation

1. Create virtual environment
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate

2. Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

3. Setup database
python scripts/setup_database.py

4. Run test
python scripts/quick_start.py

## 📦 Modules

- M1: Canonical Schema & Metadata Registry
- M2: Source Connector & Schema Profiler
- M3: AI-Assisted ERP Mapping Engine ⭐
- M4: Data Quality & Anomaly Detector
- M5: Event Builder & Case Constructor
- M6: Human-in-the-Loop Review Console
- M7: Canonical Event Log Storage

