## 👨‍💻 Development Notes

### Architecture Decisions
- **Local LLM**: Qwen2.5:7b (better Turkish support than Llama)
- **Embedding**: paraphrase-multilingual-mpnet-base-v2
- **Database**: PostgreSQL 15+
- **Mapping Strategy**: Heuristic (40%) + Embedding (20%) + LLM (40%)

### Next Steps Priority
1. Complete M2 (critical for data ingestion)
2. Complete M4 (quality is crucial)
3. Complete M5 (event construction)
4. Build M6 & M7 (UI and output)
5. End-to-end integration test


